    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Nova VPN does not collect, store or sell your browsing activity. The app does not ask for your name, phone number or email.\n\nStored only on your device: your language, selected server, activation code, and usage statistics (connection time and data used). These are never uploaded.\n\nServer list: the app downloads a configuration file to get the list of locations. Like any web request, the host of that file can see your IP address.\n\nAds: free users see ads from Google AdMob, which may use advertising identifiers. See Google\'s privacy policy for details.\n\nVPN traffic: when you connect, your traffic passes through our servers. We do not inspect or log its content.\n\nContact us through our Telegram channel.</string>
